parts.text:
I want to upgrade to latest drizzle orm and kit 1.0.0 RC. 

That chnages how migrations are done. 

Today we have a custom flatten migrations script but recently wrangler addd support for a config like this:
{
	"d1_databases": [
		{
			"binding": "DB",
			"database_name": "my-database",
			"database_id": "<UUID>",
			"migrations_dir": "migrations",
			"migrations_pattern": "migrations/*/migration.sql"
		}
	]
} 


Can we somehow migrate to this and if so, get rid of the flatten migrations script.

